{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101240","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310124001:0":{"text":"이봐요, 괜찮아요?","source_cn":"喂——你没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164A6DEC3699B074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310124002:0":{"text":"아! 아... 당신들이군요...","source_cn":"啊！啊……是你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B59D49BF34D49D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310124003:1":{"text":"제발... 제 아내와 아이를 구해주세요! 그... 그들이 어디 있는지 찾을 수가 없어요...","source_cn":"圣光在上，救救……我的妻子和孩子！我……我找不到他们了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4EC1E93B8552F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310124004:0":{"text":"초록색 불... 사, 살아있는 시체가... 우린 뛰쳐나왔어요, 하지만... 가족들이 어디에 있는지...","source_cn":"绿火……活、活死人……我们跑出来了，他们……我找不到他们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x581C63A38F2BF043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310124005:0":{"text":"샤예바... 내 사랑, 그리고 로만도, 다들... 다들 어디에 있는 거야!","source_cn":"莎耶娃……亲爱的，还有小罗曼，你们……你们在哪儿啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0834A079A00C11CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_t